{"id":"torrey:god","source":"torrey","name":"God","slug":"god","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Is a spirit — Joh 4:24; 2Co 3:17.","refs":[["John",4,24,4,24],["2Cor",3,17,3,17]]},{"text":"Light. — Isa 60:19; Jas 1:17; 1Jo 1:5.","refs":[["Isa",60,19,60,19],["Jas",1,17,1,17],["1John",1,5,1,5]]},{"text":"Love. — 1Jo 4:8,16.","refs":[["1John",4,8,4,8],["1John",4,16,4,16]]},{"text":"Invisible. — Job 23:8,9; Joh 1:18; 5:37; Col 1:15; 1Ti 1:17.","refs":[["Job",23,8,23,8],["Job",23,9,23,9],["John",1,18,1,18],["John",5,37,5,37],["Col",1,15,1,15],["1Tim",1,17,1,17]]},{"text":"Unsearchable. — Job 11:7; 37:23; Ps 145:3; Isa 40:28; Ro 11:33.","refs":[["Job",11,7,11,7],["Job",37,23,37,23],["Ps",145,3,145,3],["Isa",40,28,40,28],["Rom",11,33,11,33]]},{"text":"Incorruptible. — Ro 1:23.","refs":[["Rom",1,23,1,23]]},{"text":"Eternal. — De 33:27; Ps 90:2; Re 4:8-10.","refs":[["Deut",33,27,33,27],["Ps",90,2,90,2],["Rev",4,8,4,10]]},{"text":"Immortal. — 1Ti 1:17; 6:16.","refs":[["1Tim",1,17,1,17],["1Tim",6,16,6,16]]},{"text":"Omnipotent. — Ge 17:1; Ex 6:3.","refs":[["Gen",17,1,17,1],["Exod",6,3,6,3]]},{"text":"Omniscient. — Ps 139:1-6; Pr 5:21.","refs":[["Ps",139,1,139,6],["Prov",5,21,5,21]]},{"text":"Omnipresent. — Ps 139:7; Jer 23:23.","refs":[["Ps",139,7,139,7],["Jer",23,23,23,23]]},{"text":"Immutable. — Ps 102:26,27; Jas 1:17.","refs":[["Ps",102,26,102,26],["Ps",102,27,102,27],["Jas",1,17,1,17]]},{"text":"Only-wise. — Ro 16:27; 1Ti 1:17.","refs":[["Rom",16,27,16,27],["1Tim",1,17,1,17]]},{"text":"Glorious. — Ex 15:11; Ps 145:5.","refs":[["Exod",15,11,15,11],["Ps",145,5,145,5]]},{"text":"Most High. — Ps 83:18; Ac 7:48.","refs":[["Ps",83,18,83,18],["Acts",7,48,7,48]]},{"text":"Perfect. — Mt 5:48.","refs":[["Matt",5,48,5,48]]},{"text":"Holy. — Ps 99:9; Isa 5:16.","refs":[["Ps",99,9,99,9],["Isa",5,16,5,16]]},{"text":"Just. — De 32:4; Isa 45:21.","refs":[["Deut",32,4,32,4],["Isa",45,21,45,21]]},{"text":"True. — Jer 10:10; Joh 17:3.","refs":[["Jer",10,10,10,10],["John",17,3,17,3]]},{"text":